 "description": "List the shared memory rooms you can use \u2014 the ones you OWN plus the ones you've JOINED \u2014 each with the address to pass as `domain` on memory_read, and on memory_write too where your membership scope is read_write; a read-only membership has that write refused. Use this to RE-FIND a room in a new session (e.g. 'what rooms do I have?', 'resume the room with Olya') instead of having to create or re-join it.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
